# Core Standards

- Minimize scope: smallest correct diff only
- No comments in code unless explicitly requested
- Always create or update tests for changed behavior
- Never auto-commit; commit only when user asks
- Match existing code style, naming, and abstractions
- No secrets in code; use env vars and .env.example
- Run tests before reporting work complete
